			<div class="content" id="post-content-1481049">
									

<p>The Experiment Log for this can serve as both nightmare retardant for the actual SCP as well as its own source of nightmare fuel. It's really up to the writers what to add.</p>
<p>I'd actually like to add a creepy entry to this, just to mix things up. In fact, I think I'll get on that right now&#8230;</p>
<p>EDIT: Done. In fact, I actually like the fact this experiment log starts out goofy then goes into dark territory: just like the original article.</p>

